This Mac cannot link Linux or Windows gnfp-cminer binaries: zig cc finds no OpenSSL sysroot for x86_64-linux-gnu or x86_64-windows-gnu (libssl / libcrypto).
Linux pack is source: apt-get install build-essential libssl-dev && make
Windows pack is source + pack/win/gnfp-cminer.cmd: MinGW + OpenSSL + pthreads
Pack names: gnfp-cminer-1.1.0-{macos,linux,windows} on public tag v1.1.0 (no sibling tags).
https://github.com/rgsneddon/gnfp-cminer/releases/tag/v1.1.0
